Life in this patch</h2><button id="close-life">Close</button></div><p id="life-summary" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="life-conditions"></p><div id="life-cohorts"></div><div id="fine-water" hidden><p>Selected patch water · fine adjustment. Time keeps running unless paused.</p><button id="water-minus">−0.1 m water</button> <button id="water-plus">+0.1 m water</button><div id="target-water" hidden><p>Set this patch to an explicit depth. This supplies or removes water once, not automatic care.</p><label for="water-target">Target depth (metres, 0–5)</label><input id="water-target" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="5" step="any" value="0.5"><button id="water-target-apply">Set depth</button> <button id="water-shallow">Set 0.5 m</button><button id="make-pond">Shape basin + add water</button><p>Shapes up to 19 terrain patches: a level floor and dry rim raised at least 17 m above it. Supplies 15 m water to the floor and drains the rim once. Existing life is not replaced; changed terrain/water can affect it. No automatic refill.</p></div><p id="water-feedback" aria-live="polite"></p></div><button id="refresh-life">Refresh snapshot</button><p id="life-glossary" class="life-note"></p><p class="life-note">Current cohorts only, not a complete family history. Parent IDs may refer to lineages no longer here. A descendant is not automatically a new species.</p></dialog><section id="guide" hidden><button id="close-guide">Close</button><h2 id="guide-heading">Sandbox habitat guide</h2><div id="goal-card" aria-live="polite"><h3 id="goal-title">Start a habitat</h3><p id="goal-text">Start the game, then check your habitat for a suggested next step.</p></div><div class="guide-actions"><button id="check-habitat">Check habitat</button><button id="guide-land">Find land</button><button id="repeat-guide">First steps</button></div><p><span id="mode-explanation">This sandbox starts with plants and rabbits. It does not yet evolve simple life into new plant or animal groups. Suggestions