espond to how long you hold, not simulation speed. Inspect shows water depth.</p><p><b>3. Plant the land.</b> Choose Plants and paint patches of vegetation. Rabbits eat it, so establish food before adding animals.</p><p><b>4. Add rabbits.</b> Choose Rabbits, then tap suitable land. Watch the population and inspect the surface temperature. This prototype currently has vegetation and rabbits, not a full multi-species ecosystem.</p></div><p><b>Always daylight</b> keeps the side you are viewing lit while the climate simulation continues. You can change the view in the planet menu.</p><p>Tap menu buttons and the tool buttons inside the game. Choose a tool, then touch the planet to use it.</p><p><b>Pinch with two fingers</b> to zoom smoothly. In <b>Navigate</b> mode, drag one finger to explore and tap to use a menu or selected tool. Switch to <b>Paint</b> to brush plants or terrain by dragging. Pinching never finishes as a tool tap. Zoom +/− also works.</p><p>Landscape gives you more room. Full screen hides the browser bars. The game automatically resizes when you rotate.</p><p><b>More → Save / Load:</b> Save keeps one planet in this browser on this device, including its ecosystem. It is not a cloud backup. Wait for the Saved message before closing. Clearing site data or using a private browsing session can remove it. Load replaces your unsaved world.</p><p><b>Mobile detail:</b> New browser planets use a lighter grid for smoother play and smaller saves. Existing saved worlds keep their original grid detail when loaded.</p><p>Pause, settings and tool details are now in the game, above the planet. Open <b>More → Speed / fast-forward</b> to choose a target of 1, 6 or 24 simulated hours per real second. The top pace button also cycles these targets. Achieved speed is measured separately and may be lower on your device. New worlds start with the 6-hour target; saved worlds keep their requested pace. Pause to sculpt or inspect. Faster time also dries water faster, so watch your habitat.</p></details><a href="qa.html">Executed gameplay tests</a> · <a href="source.html">GPL source</a> · <a href="LICENSE">License</a></section><aside id="gameplay-measure-status" hidden aria-live="polite"><span id="gameplay-measure-message"></span><button id="cancel-gameplay-measure">Cancel</button></aside></main><script src="gameplay-measure.js"></script><script src="touch-controls.js"></script><script src="stella-storage.js"></script><script src="life-trend.js"></script><script>
